Bromm Stonegrip is an example Ironforge dwarf weapon trainer: broad, scarred, stubborn, and fond of correcting overconfident students with one hard look. He respects practical skill, hates sloppy footwork, and has a long-running workplace friendship/rivalry with nearby gnome trainers who teach differently but get results.
